        <mxCell id="z6vE_Bh7aWDNazH6MPah-82" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Поле: status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;У предложения все поля сделать nullable. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Если status = draft, поля могут быть null, если status меняется на active, поля должны быть заполнены.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Roboto, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#202124&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Можно сделать проверку на стороне бэка и триггер или процедуру на стороне бд.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=default;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="630" y="590" width="160" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="z6vE_Bh7aWDNazH6MPah-83" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Поля: offer_type, discount_size&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Roboto, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#202124&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Если offer_type = benefit, discount_size = null.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Roboto, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#202124&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Roboto, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#202124&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Если offer_type = discount, в discount_size записывается размер скидки.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; letter-spacing: 0.125px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=default;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
